.TH RUN 1 "2026" "Cyberus Linux Quest" "Mission 02 Manual"
.SH NAME
run \- Home Sweet Home challenge binary
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B /challenge/run
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B /challenge/run
is a polite program that only helps users who ask nicely from inside a folder in their home directory.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-verbose
Print extra diagnostic status messages.
.TP
.BR \-p ", " \-\-please
Ask nicely to reveal instructions for claiming the flag.
.TP
.BR \-d ", " \-\-dry\-run
Simulate execution without writing any files.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Display help and list supported options.
